@page "/"

<PageTitle>Planets &amp; Satellites</PageTitle>

<MudStack Spacing="4" AlignItems="AlignItems.Center" Class="mt-8">
    <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Public" Size="Size.Large" Style="font-size: 6rem;" Color="Color.Primary" />
    <MudText Typo="Typo.h3" Align="Align.Center">Planets &amp; Satellites</MudText>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.subtitle1" Align="Align.Center" Class="mud-text-secondary" Style="max-width: 600px;">
        .NET 9 microservices demo: HTTP · gRPC · RabbitMQ · JWT · Kubernetes.
        Log in to explore planets and their satellites.
    </MudText>

    <AuthorizeView>
        <Authorized>
            <MudButton Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Primary" Size="Size.Large"
                       Href="/planets" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Rocket">
                View planets
            </MudButton>
        </Authorized>
        <NotAuthorized>
            <MudStack Row="true" Spacing="2">
                <MudButton Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Primary" Size="Size.Large"
                           Href="/login" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Login">
                    Login
                </MudButton>
                <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" Color="Color.Primary" Size="Size.Large"
                           Href="/register" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.PersonAdd">
                    Register
                </MudButton>
            </MudStack>
        </NotAuthorized>
    </AuthorizeView>
</MudStack>

<MudContainer MaxWidth="MaxWidth.Medium" Class="mt-10">
    <TechInfoPanel Title="Architecture at a glance">
        <Body>
            <p><b>Three .NET 9 microservices</b>, each in its own container:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><b>AuthService</b> (:7000) — ASP.NET Core Identity + JWT issuer. <b>SQL Server</b> persistence (<code>AuthDb</code>).</li>
                <li><b>PlanetService</b> (:5000 REST, :50051 gRPC) — planet CRUD. <b>EF InMemory</b> in dev, SQL Server in prod. Publishes events to RabbitMQ, exposes gRPC server.</li>
                <li><b>SatelliteService</b> (:6001 → container :6000 — Chrome blocks :6000) — satellite CRUD + replicated planets. <b>EF InMemory</b>. Consumes RabbitMQ, calls PlanetService gRPC on startup.</li>
            </ul>

            <p><b>Three communication patterns</b>, deliberately:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><b>Synchronous REST</b> — Blazor → all three services; plus PlanetService → SatelliteService fire-and-forget notification.</li>
                <li><b>Synchronous gRPC</b> — SatelliteService bootstraps its planet cache from PlanetService on startup (<code>PrepDb.PrepPopulation</code>).</li>
                <li><b>Asynchronous RabbitMQ</b> — PlanetService publishes <code>Planet_Published</code> events to a fanout exchange <code>"trigger"</code>; SatelliteService subscribes and replicates.</li>
            </ul>

        </Body>
    </TechInfoPanel>
</MudContainer>
